<title>AUSTRALIA: Mirvac year net profit up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Mirvac year net profit up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    33.92 vs 27.62</p>
<p>    Net				     21.75 vs 18.03</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     4.00 vs 3.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Mirvac Ltd is a property developer and manager. The company is 19.65 percent owned by developer and civil engineer Lend Lease Corp Ltd who also hold convertible notes that allow it to increase its stake up to 25 percent.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     7.00 vs 5.00</p>
<p>    Sales				  337.63 vs 216.50</p>
<p>    Other income			   6.09 vs 10.49</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   14.55 vs 12.53</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 29</p>
<p>Reg date Nov 15</p>
<p>    Tax				     12.17 vs 8.74</p>
<p>    Interest				13.68 vs 12.06</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.59 vs 3.06</p>
